WEBVTT

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.682
but also talk about how
we can get out of this

00:01:01.682 --> 00:01:04.102
and how we need to be better prepared.

00:01:04.143 --> 00:01:06.562
And I am incredibly hopeful

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:08.856
that number one,
we’ll get out of this pandemic,

00:01:08.856 --> 00:01:09.982
because we will.

00:01:10.024 --> 00:01:12.485
We will persevere,
we will get out of this pandemic.

00:01:12.485 --> 00:01:15.988
But what we have to do
is work so hard to make sure

00:01:15.988 --> 00:01:18.074
that we’re better prepared
for the next one,

00:01:18.074 --> 00:01:19.826
because unfortunately there will be.

00:01:19.826 --> 00:01:21.160
And every single one of us,

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.746
every single one of you,
in the role that you have,

00:01:23.788 --> 00:01:25.081
wherever you are,

00:01:25.081 --> 00:01:28.042
have a role to play in making sure
that we are better prepared

00:01:28.084 --> 00:01:30.878
and that we handle the next one better.